    },
    {
      "id": "P04-S06-U10",
      "role": "counselor",
      "text": "你让它那么摆着，本身已经是另一个动作了——手停下来了，可心里那个“错字”还卡着，像吞不下去也吐不出来。把电视声音调大两格，也许是在用外面的声音盖住那句你没接的话，让它暂时不落在身上。",
      "request_sha256": "2ca7dd0fcca260a5052de8c83f48cfe6161e1f614433fc6b8488d50fe09ccaaa",
      "usage": {
        "input_tokens": 7941,
        "input_tokens_details": {
          "cached_tokens": 7168
        },
        "output_tokens": 320,
        "output_tokens_details": {
          "reasoning_tokens": 259
        },
        "total_tokens": 8261,
        "x_details": [
          {
            "input_tokens": 7941,
            "output_tokens": 320,
            "output_tokens_details": {
              "reasoning_tokens": 259
            },
            "prompt_tokens_details": {
              "cached_tokens": 7168
            },
            "total_tokens": 8261,
            "x_billing_type": "response_api"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "P04-S06-U11",
      "role": "client",
      "text": "电视声音是开得有点大，连广告里那个“幸福一家人”的背景音都震耳朵。我后来也没换台，就那么听完了两段广告，像有人替我把那话接着讲下去——总比我空着强。药盒……就让它那么摆着吧，我手再伸过去，像跟谁较劲似的，没意思。",
      "request_sha256": "e437d8eb536af3738228bf6514a206b4ce9ea257599dd60a1dd4ab6f58f4f073",
      "usage": {
        "input_tokens": 8717,
        "input_tokens_details": {
          "cached_tokens": 7168
        },
        "output_tokens": 597,
        "output_tokens_details": {
          "reasoning_tokens": 519
        },
        "total_tokens": 9314,
        "x_details": [
          {
            "input_tokens": 8717,
            "output_tokens": 597,
            "output_tokens_details": {
              "reasoning_tokens": 519
            },
            "prompt_tokens_details": {
              "cached_tokens": 7168
            },
            "total_tokens": 9314,
            "x_billing_type": "response_api"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "P04-S06-U12",
      "role": "counselor",
      "text": "让药盒就那么摆着，手不再伸过去，也许比改回原来的顺序更需要力气。今晚可以先不分辨这是松开还是累了，就让它这样待着。下次如果你还愿意，也许可以再来说说那句被广告声接过去的话——它没消失，只是被暂时盖住了。",
      "request_sha256": "457dd2d004daf6087562131b50683bfb756db3437b56ed567d752e3d97a9d60e",
      "usage": {
        "input_tokens": 8132,
        "input_tokens_details": {
          "cached_tokens": 7168
        },
        "output_tokens": 291,
        "output_tokens_details": {
          "reasoning_tokens": 226
        },
        "total_tokens": 8423,
        "x_details": [
          {
            "input_tokens": 8132,
            "output_tokens": 291,
            "output_tokens_details": {
              "reasoning_tokens": 226
            },
            "prompt_tokens_details": {
              "cached_tokens": 7168
            },
            "total_tokens": 8423,
            "x_billing_type": "response_api"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "P04-S06-U13",
      "role": "client",
      "text": "今天可能先说到这儿吧，药盒我不动了，就让它那么摆着。电视还开着，等会儿回去把它关小一点，不然我妈该说我费电。护工明天还来，我……还没想好怎么跟她同在一个厨房里待着。",
      "request_sha256": "e2d0e8caf8027eee043ab68c10ebd83fc313cb078d5ca11c65ab8e9f56ce5144",
      "usage": {
        "input_tokens": 8905,
        "input_tokens_details": {
